.TH WORDCOUNT 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
wordCount \- count lines, words and characters in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int wordCount(FILE *" file ", int *" lines ", int *" words ", int *" chars ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads through the open file stream
.I file
and fills
.IR lines ", " words ", and " chars
with the respective counts.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 0 on success, -1 on failure.
.SH AUTHOR
Your Name <your.email@example.com>
